    "created_at": "2025-07-14T18:51:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-14T18:51:45Z",
    "body": "Ah yes I see what you mean. Perhaps the empty string should be special cased in the Cookie Store API spec.\n\nI can add telemetry to Chrome to see how often we encounter this in the wild. If it's not that much I would be more open to changing the current behavior.",
